---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Guestbook from '../components/Guestbook.jsx';
---

<Layout title="Obed Erwin Manambe | Fullstack Software Engineer">
	<div class="lg:flex lg:justify-between lg:gap-4">
		
		<!-- KIRI: Header / Bio Statis -->
		<header class="lg:sticky lg:top-0 lg:flex lg:max-h-screen lg:w-1/2 lg:flex-col lg:justify-between lg:py-24">
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
				
				<!-- Avatar dengan effect fade-bottom & hover reveal -->
				<img 
					src="/avatar.png" 
					alt="Obed Erwin Manambe" 
					class="mb-6 w-44 h-44 md:w-52 md:h-52 rounded-2xl object-cover opacity-90 mix-blend-luminosity hover:mix-blend-normal transition-all duration-500 shadow-2xl"
					style="mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 65%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 65%, transparent 100%);"
				/>

				<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100 sm:text-5xl">
					<a href="/">Obed Erwin Manambe</a>
				</h1>
				<h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-teal-300 sm:text-xl">
					Fullstack Software Engineer
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm font-normal text-slate-400">
					Head of IT Division — Dept. of Communication & Informatics, Talaud Islands Regency
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 max-w-xs leading-normal text-slate-400 text-sm">
					Building high-availability public services, field operation PWAs, and high-performance backend systems on Linux infrastructure.
				</p>

				<!-- Quick Tech Badges -->
				<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-1.5 max-w-xs">
					<span class="rounded bg-slate-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-teal-300">TypeScript</span>
					<span class="rounded bg-slate-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-teal-300">Go</span>
					<span class="rounded bg-slate-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-teal-300">Next.js</span>
					<span class="rounded bg-slate-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-teal-300">Laravel</span>
					<span class="rounded bg-slate-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-teal-300">PostgreSQL</span>
					<span class="rounded bg-slate-800/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-teal-300">Ubuntu Server</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Navigasi / Contact quick links -->
			<div class="mt-8 lg:mt-0 flex gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
				<a href="mailto:obed.manambe@gmail.com" class="hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">obed.manambe@gmail.com</a>
				<span>•</span>
				<a href="https://github.com/obedman-gh" target="_blank" class="hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">GitHub</a>
				<span>•</span>
				<a href="https://obedman.my.id" class="hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">obedman.my.id</a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- KANAN: Content Scrollable -->
		<main id="content" class="pt-16 lg:w-1/2 lg:py-24">
			
			<!-- SECTION: ABOUT -->
			<section id="about" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24">
				<h3 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-300 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400 inline-block"></span> About Me
				</h3>
				<p class="mb-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					Saya adalah seorang <strong class="text-slate-200 font-medium">Hands-on Fullstack Software Engineer</strong> dan Kepala Bidang Teknologi Informasi di Dinas Komunikasi dan Informatika Kabupaten Kepulauan Talaud. Saya berfokus membangun aplikasi layanan publik berbasis web, sistem manajemen dokumen daerah, dan aplikasi survei lapangan.
				</p>
				<p class="mb-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					Perjalanan rekayasa perangkat lunak saya dimulai dari era aplikasi desktop berbasis database <strong class="text-slate-200 font-medium font-mono">dBASE, FoxBASE, dan CA-Clipper</strong>, hingga kini aktif merancang ekosistem modern menggunakan <strong class="text-teal-300 font-medium">Go, Node.js, PHP Laravel, Next.js, Astro, dan TypeScript</strong>.
				</p>
				<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					Selain penulisan kode *frontend* & *backend*, saya bertanggung jawab langsung atas konfigurasi infrastruktur <strong class="text-slate-200 font-medium">Ubuntu Server, Nginx, Caddy, Cloudflare Tunnel, Docker, systemd</strong>, hingga pengujian berkala untuk strategi *backup & restore* basis data PostgreSQL dan MySQL.
				</p>

				<!-- Comprehensive Skills Matrix -->
				<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-300 font-bold mb-2 text-teal-300">Frontend Stack</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">TypeScript, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Astro, Tailwind CSS, Vite, HTML/CSS</div>
					</div>
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-300 font-bold mb-2 text-teal-300">Backend & API</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Go (Golang), Node.js, PHP, Laravel, RESTful APIs, Auth & RBAC</div>
					</div>
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-300 font-bold mb-2 text-teal-300">Database Engine</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB, SQLite, SQL Optimization, Backup & Recovery</div>
					</div>
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-300 font-bold mb-2 text-teal-300">DevOps & Linux</div>
						<div class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Ubuntu Server, Nginx, Caddy, Cloudflare Tunnels, Docker, systemd, Git</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- SECTION: APP SHOWCASE & SCREENSHOTS (NEW) -->
			<section id="showcase" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24">
				<h3 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-300 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400 inline-block"></span> App Screenshots & Live Visuals
				</h3>
				<p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mb-8">
					Tampilan visual langsung dari sistem operasional pemerintah daerah dan aplikasi survei lapangan.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
					
					<!-- Screenshot Card 1: JDIH Talaud -->
					<div class="group relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
						<div class="aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 relative">
							<img 
								src="/screenshots/jdih-talaud.png" 
								alt="JDIH Talaud Application Interface" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-85 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500"
								data-fallback="https://placehold.co/800x450/0f172a/94a3b8?text=JDIH+Talaud+Portal"
							/>
							<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
						</div>
						<div class="p-5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
								<h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">JDIH Talaud</h4>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-400/10 text-teal-300">Legal Document Portal</span>
							</div>
							<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								Portal publik produk hukum daerah Kabupaten Kepulauan Talaud dilengkapi pencarian cepat dan alur kerja verifikasi publikasi dokumen.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Screenshot Card 2: SIPORODISA -->
					<div class="group relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
						<div class="aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 relative">
							<img 
								src="/screenshots/siporodisa.png" 
								alt="SIPORODISA Application Interface" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-85 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500"
								data-fallback="https://placehold.co/800x450/0f172a/94a3b8?text=SIPORODISA+Data+Catalog"
							/>
							<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
						</div>
						<div class="p-5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
								<h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">SIPORODISA</h4>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-400/10 text-teal-300">Regional Data Catalog</span>
							</div>
							<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								Katalog data spasial dan publikasi PDF statistik regional Talaud dengan mode ganda (Real & Demo mode).
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Screenshot Card 3: TALACOS -->
					<div class="group relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
						<div class="aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 relative">
							<img 
								src="/screenshots/talacos.png" 
								alt="TALACOS Tourism Portal" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-85 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500"
								data-fallback="https://placehold.co/800x450/0f172a/94a3b8?text=TALACOS+Tourism+Portal"
							/>
							<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
						</div>
						<div class="p-5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
								<h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">TALACOS</h4>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-400/10 text-teal-300">Tourism & Culture Portal</span>
							</div>
							<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								Portal pariwisata dan kebudayaan daerah dengan peta interaktif pencarian destinasi wisata dan perencanaan perjalanan.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Screenshot Card 4: LAMT -->
					<div class="group relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
						<div class="aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 relative">
							<img 
								src="/screenshots/lamt.png" 
								alt="LAMT Land Survey App" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-85 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500"
								data-fallback="https://placehold.co/800x450/0f172a/94a3b8?text=LAMT+Field+Survey+PWA"
							/>
							<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
						</div>
						<div class="p-5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
								<h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">LAMT (Land Survey PWA)</h4>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-400/10 text-teal-300">Offline-First Field PWA</span>
							</div>
							<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								Aplikasi pengukuran lahan offline-first untuk titik koordinat batas lahan di lapangan dengan sinkronisasi data otomatis.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Screenshot Card 5: Nexus Pemdi -->
					<div class="group relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
						<div class="aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 relative">
							<img 
								src="/screenshots/nexus-pemdi.png" 
								alt="Nexus Pemdi Talaud Map" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-85 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500"
								data-fallback="https://placehold.co/800x450/0f172a/94a3b8?text=Nexus+Pemdi+Regulation+Map"
							/>
							<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
						</div>
						<div class="p-5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
								<h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">Nexus Pemdi Talaud</h4>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-400/10 text-teal-300">Interactive Regulation Map</span>
							</div>
							<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								Visualisasi pemetaan interaktif keterhubungan ekosistem regulasi dan kebijakan penyelenggaraan pemerintah digital.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- SECTION: SELECTED PROJECTS LIST -->
			<section id="projects" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24">
				<h3 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-300 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400 inline-block"></span> Selected Engineering Projects
				</h3>
				
				<ul class="group/list space-y-8">
					
					<!-- Project: JDIH Talaud -->
					<li class="transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-60">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 rounded-lg p-4 hover:bg-slate-900/60 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2024 - Active</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h4 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">
									JDIH Talaud — Legal Document Portal ↗
								</h4>
								<p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									Portal publik penelusuran dan penerbitan dokumen hukum daerah. Dilengkapi sistem pencarian parametrik cepat serta alur kerja *publish/withdraw* dokumen.
								</p>
								<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">Next.js</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">PostgreSQL</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">TypeScript</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</li>

					<!-- Project: SIPORODISA -->
					<li class="transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-60">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 rounded-lg p-4 hover:bg-slate-900/60 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2024</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h4 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">
									SIPORODISA — Regional Data Catalog ↗
								</h4>
								<p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									Katalog data daerah dan alur publikasi dokumen PDF statistik regional. Memiliki arsitektur mode terpisah antara *real production* dan *demo mode*.
								</p>
								<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">Next.js</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">PostgreSQL</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</li>

					<!-- Project: TALACOS -->
					<li class="transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-60">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 rounded-lg p-4 hover:bg-slate-900/60 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2024</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h4 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">
									TALACOS — Tourism & Culture Portal ↗
								</h4>
								<p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									Portal informasi pariwisata dan kebudayaan daerah dengan modul ekplorasi destinasi wisata, penandaan peta lokasi, serta fitur perencanaan rute perjalanan.
								</p>
								<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">Next.js</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">React</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">REST API</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</li>

					<!-- Project: LAMT -->
					<li class="transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-60">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 rounded-lg p-4 hover:bg-slate-900/60 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2023 - 2024</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h4 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">
									LAMT — Offline-First Land Survey PWA ↗
								</h4>
								<p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									Progressive Web App (PWA) pengukuran lahan *offline-first*. Mampu merekam titik GPS lokasi lahan tanpa koneksi internet dan melakukan sinkronisasi otomatis saat *online*.
								</p>
								<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">TypeScript</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">Node.js</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">SQLite</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">PWA</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</li>

					<!-- Project: SIGAP Talaud -->
					<li class="transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-60">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 rounded-lg p-4 hover:bg-slate-900/60 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2023</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h4 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">
									SIGAP Talaud — Permit & Registration Portal ↗
								</h4>
								<p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									Sistem informasi perizinan dan pendaftaran publik berbasis dashboard administratif tingkat kabupaten.
								</p>
								<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">PHP</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">Laravel</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">MySQL</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</li>

					<!-- Existing Project: Go API & Microservices -->
					<li class="transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-60">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 rounded-lg p-4 hover:bg-slate-900/60 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2024</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h4 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200 group-hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors">
									High-Performance Go REST API & Infrastructure ↗
								</h4>
								<p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									Layanan API berkinerja tinggi menggunakan Go (Fiber v2) dan PostgreSQL yang berjalan di lingkungan Ubuntu Server & Cloudflare Tunnels.
								</p>
								<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">Go (Golang)</span>
									<span class="rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-300">PostgreSQL</span>
